The file src/field-face-neutral.json (also copied next to the built bundle, and
inlined into it) contains 468 landmark positions and 898 triangles derived from
that model, normalized into the face space this library uses. Its landmark index
space, its triangulation and the region index sets in src/field-face-asset.ts
all follow the MediaPipe convention.

